{"id": "wwdc2019-301", "language": "eng", "source": "https://developer.apple.com/videos/play/wwdc2019/301", "wordCount": 4193, "segments": [{"start": 15.0, "text": "Hello and welcome to our"}, {"start": 16.0, "text": "session on What's New in App"}, {"start": 18.0, "text": "Store Connect."}, {"start": 19.0, "text": "My name is Tommy McGlynn and I'm"}, {"start": 21.0, "text": "an App Store Connect Engineer."}, {"start": 24.0, "text": "Today our focus is the App"}, {"start": 26.0, "text": "Lifecycle."}, {"start": 27.0, "text": "This is everything from the"}, {"start": 28.0, "text": "moment you first began creating"}, {"start": 30.0, "text": "an app to the moment you make it"}, {"start": 32.0, "text": "available in the App Store."}, {"start": 36.0, "text": "As we look at the lifecycle"}, {"start": 37.0, "text": "today, we'll highlight some"}, {"start": 38.0, "text": "things that are important to"}, {"start": 39.0, "text": "know and we'll look at recent"}, {"start": 42.0, "text": "improvements to specific phases"}, {"start": 43.0, "text": "of the lifecycle."}, {"start": 45.0, "text": "And finally we'll look at some"}, {"start": 47.0, "text": "brand new features that you"}, {"start": 48.0, "text": "haven't seen yet."}, {"start": 50.0, "text": "So let's begin where it all"}, {"start": 52.0, "text": "starts for every developer and"}, {"start": 54.0, "text": "that's where we design and"}, {"start": 55.0, "text": "develop apps in Xcode."}, {"start": 57.0, "text": "Xcode is where you create apps,"}, {"start": 60.0, "text": "and we've just announced that"}, {"start": 61.0, "text": "you can now deliver amazing"}, {"start": 63.0, "text": "watch apps without needing to"}, {"start": 65.0, "text": "build an iOS companion app."}, {"start": 68.0, "text": "And these apps will be fully"}, {"start": 70.0, "text": "supported in App Store Connect"}, {"start": 72.0, "text": "from TestFlight through to"}, {"start": 74.0, "text": "through to the App Store and"}, {"start": 76.0, "text": "customers can discover your app"}, {"start": 79.0, "text": "right on their watch, in the new"}, {"start": 81.0, "text": "App Store built specifically for"}, {"start": 83.0, "text": "Apple Watch."}, {"start": 87.0, "text": "Now you've built an app in Xcode"}, {"start": 89.0, "text": "and you're ready to share it"}, {"start": 90.0, "text": "with the world."}, {"start": 91.0, "text": "The next step is to upload your"}, {"start": 94.0, "text": "app."}, {"start": 97.0, "text": "A common way to deliver apps"}, {"start": 98.0, "text": "today is within Xcode or with"}, {"start": 101.0, "text": "Application Loader which is an"}, {"start": 103.0, "text": "app that's installed with Xcode."}, {"start": 107.0, "text": "Beginning with the beta of Xcode"}, {"start": 108.0, "text": "11, Application Loader will no"}, {"start": 110.0, "text": "longer be included."}, {"start": 112.0, "text": "Instead, we've created a new"}, {"start": 114.0, "text": "dedicated experience for"}, {"start": 116.0, "text": "delivering apps that does not"}, {"start": 117.0, "text": "require you to install Xcode."}, {"start": 120.0, "text": "It's called Transporter."}, {"start": 122.0, "text": "This is a dedicated Mac App"}, {"start": 125.0, "text": "that's super easy to use and"}, {"start": 126.0, "text": "it's a great way to deliver your"}, {"start": 128.0, "text": "apps."}, {"start": 130.0, "text": "Transporter is also a localized"}, {"start": 132.0, "text": "app."}, {"start": 133.0, "text": "So it's a great experience for"}, {"start": 134.0, "text": "anyone on your team across many"}, {"start": 136.0, "text": "languages."}, {"start": 138.0, "text": "So let's take a closer look at"}, {"start": 140.0, "text": "how to use Transporter."}, {"start": 142.0, "text": "First you sign in with your"}, {"start": 144.0, "text": "Apple ID."}, {"start": 146.0, "text": "Then if you belong to multiple"}, {"start": 148.0, "text": "teams, you'll choose one from"}, {"start": 149.0, "text": "the drop-down list."}, {"start": 153.0, "text": "Now it's time to select the"}, {"start": 154.0, "text": "files that you want to deliver."}, {"start": 156.0, "text": "Transporter uses a simple"}, {"start": 158.0, "text": "drag-and-drop interface."}, {"start": 159.0, "text": "You just take your IPA that"}, {"start": 162.0, "text": "you've exported from Xcode, drag"}, {"start": 164.0, "text": "it over Transporter and drop."}, {"start": 166.0, "text": "From there it's a simple click"}, {"start": 169.0, "text": "to begin verifying the package."}, {"start": 172.0, "text": "Transporter will display"}, {"start": 174.0, "text": "warnings and errors that occur"}, {"start": 175.0, "text": "during validation so you can"}, {"start": 177.0, "text": "find and fix them early."}, {"start": 181.0, "text": "Once errors have been addressed"}, {"start": 183.0, "text": "you can click to deliver the"}, {"start": 184.0, "text": "package."}, {"start": 186.0, "text": "Transporter will display"}, {"start": 187.0, "text": "delivery progress and you have"}, {"start": 190.0, "text": "the option to cancel or restart"}, {"start": 192.0, "text": "deliveries that have not yet"}, {"start": 193.0, "text": "completed."}, {"start": 195.0, "text": "You also have the option to"}, {"start": 197.0, "text": "verify many packages at the same"}, {"start": 199.0, "text": "time."}, {"start": 200.0, "text": "Simply drag all of them into"}, {"start": 202.0, "text": "Transporter and click to begin"}, {"start": 204.0, "text": "validation."}, {"start": 205.0, "text": "That's transporter for Mac."}, {"start": 207.0, "text": "It's really easy, and I know it"}, {"start": 208.0, "text": "could be a great tool for your"}, {"start": 210.0, "text": "team."}, {"start": 212.0, "text": "So once your app is uploaded, we"}, {"start": 214.0, "text": "do some further validations and"}, {"start": 217.0, "text": "some issues can only be"}, {"start": 219.0, "text": "diagnosed after we've received"}, {"start": 220.0, "text": "your app."}, {"start": 222.0, "text": "If we do find any issues, you'll"}, {"start": 223.0, "text": "receive an email to let you"}, {"start": 225.0, "text": "know, and we've recently made"}, {"start": 228.0, "text": "some enhancements to these"}, {"start": 230.0, "text": "emails."}, {"start": 231.0, "text": "First we added the version"}, {"start": 233.0, "text": "number prominently in the"}, {"start": 234.0, "text": "subject line."}, {"start": 237.0, "text": "We also added additional context"}, {"start": 239.0, "text": "to help you quickly understand"}, {"start": 241.0, "text": "the problem. And finally we added numeric"}, {"start": 245.0, "text": "codes for each error."}, {"start": 247.0, "text": "These will help you find more"}, {"start": 248.0, "text": "details on each error type."}, {"start": 252.0, "text": "We've also introduced a new way"}, {"start": 254.0, "text": "to view your builds after"}, {"start": 255.0, "text": "they've been uploaded with the"}, {"start": 257.0, "text": "new Build Activity View in App"}, {"start": 259.0, "text": "Store Connect for iOS, where you"}, {"start": 262.0, "text": "can see all of the recent builds"}, {"start": 264.0, "text": "that you've uploaded along with"}, {"start": 266.0, "text": "detailed information about each"}, {"start": 267.0, "text": "build as well as the download"}, {"start": 271.0, "text": "and install sizes for each"}, {"start": 272.0, "text": "device model."}, {"start": 275.0, "text": "In addition to Build Activity,"}, {"start": 277.0, "text": "there's a new notification type"}, {"start": 278.0, "text": "that you can enable called Build"}, {"start": 281.0, "text": "Processing Changes."}, {"start": 283.0, "text": "This is a great way to be"}, {"start": 285.0, "text": "notified immediately as your"}, {"start": 286.0, "text": "builds finish processing."}, {"start": 291.0, "text": "Now you've delivered your app"}, {"start": 292.0, "text": "and you're moving from"}, {"start": 294.0, "text": "development into the testing"}, {"start": 295.0, "text": "phase."}, {"start": 297.0, "text": "The next step in the App"}, {"start": 298.0, "text": "Lifecycle is TestFlight."}, {"start": 301.0, "text": "We've built some exciting new"}, {"start": 302.0, "text": "features for TestFlight and to"}, {"start": 303.0, "text": "tell you all about it I'd like"}, {"start": 305.0, "text": "to invite Payam on stage."}, {"start": 313.0, "text": "Hi everyone."}, {"start": 314.0, "text": "My name Payam Yousefi"}, {"start": 316.0, "text": "and I'm an engineer on App Store Connect."}, {"start": 317.0, "text": "I'm really excited to be here"}, {"start": 319.0, "text": "today to tell you all about"}, {"start": 321.0, "text": "what's new with TestFlight, but"}, {"start": 323.0, "text": "first let's reflect a little"}, {"start": 325.0, "text": "bit."}, {"start": 326.0, "text": "Last year we introduced Public"}, {"start": 329.0, "text": "Links."}, {"start": 330.0, "text": "This made it so much easier for"}, {"start": 332.0, "text": "you to invite lots of new people"}, {"start": 334.0, "text": "to test their apps."}, {"start": 335.0, "text": "All you needed to do is create a"}, {"start": 337.0, "text": "unique URL, you can share it"}, {"start": 339.0, "text": "with anyone, anywhere all"}, {"start": 341.0, "text": "without an email address."}, {"start": 342.0, "text": "One of the first adopters of"}, {"start": 345.0, "text": "Public Links was Snapchat and"}, {"start": 348.0, "text": "they had some great things to"}, {"start": 349.0, "text": "say."}, {"start": 351.0, "text": "I'd like to read it to you now."}, {"start": 353.0, "text": "TestFlight Public Links reduce"}, {"start": 355.0, "text": "friction for our testers."}, {"start": 356.0, "text": "It increased our tester pool in"}, {"start": 358.0, "text": "a way that's lightweight and"}, {"start": 360.0, "text": "easier to maintain while"}, {"start": 362.0, "text": "providing us with more than"}, {"start": 363.0, "text": "twice the amount of useful"}, {"start": 365.0, "text": "pre-release feedback."}, {"start": 367.0, "text": "It's that awesome?"}, {"start": 368.0, "text": "And we've been working harder to"}, {"start": 370.0, "text": "reduce friction for testers even"}, {"start": 372.0, "text": "more."}, {"start": 374.0, "text": "This year we improved the"}, {"start": 376.0, "text": "TestFlight app by localizing it"}, {"start": 378.0, "text": "in dozens of additional"}, {"start": 379.0, "text": "language."}, {"start": 381.0, "text": "That means that it's even more"}, {"start": 383.0, "text": "effortless for testers worldwide"}, {"start": 385.0, "text": "to start testing their apps."}, {"start": 388.0, "text": "And now that you have lots of new testers, you're probably"}, {"start": 390.0, "text": "eager to hear from them."}, {"start": 393.0, "text": "We know how important it is for"}, {"start": 395.0, "text": "you to learn about new bugs and"}, {"start": 396.0, "text": "crashes as soon as they happen"}, {"start": 398.0, "text": "during the testing phase, and we"}, {"start": 401.0, "text": "know that sometimes you don't"}, {"start": 402.0, "text": "always get all the detail you"}, {"start": 403.0, "text": "need from your testers when they"}, {"start": 404.0, "text": "send you issues."}, {"start": 406.0, "text": "So today I'm really excited to"}, {"start": 408.0, "text": "announce something completely"}, {"start": 409.0, "text": "new for TestFlight."}, {"start": 411.0, "text": "We've printed features that will"}, {"start": 412.0, "text": "improve the beta testing"}, {"start": 413.0, "text": "experience, and we call it"}, {"start": 416.0, "text": "TestFlight Feedback."}, {"start": 423.0, "text": "Yeah, these are some great"}, {"start": 424.0, "text": "enhancements that help increase"}, {"start": 425.0, "text": "the quality and quantity of"}, {"start": 427.0, "text": "feedback you receive from your"}, {"start": 428.0, "text": "beta testers."}, {"start": 431.0, "text": "So now when testers first start"}, {"start": 432.0, "text": "testing your app, they're see a"}, {"start": 434.0, "text": "new onboarding experience that"}, {"start": 436.0, "text": "helps them get up to speed on"}, {"start": 437.0, "text": "what to test and how to start"}, {"start": 439.0, "text": "sending you feedback."}, {"start": 441.0, "text": "Now there's two new ways to"}, {"start": 443.0, "text": "start sending feedback."}, {"start": 445.0, "text": "First, testers can send"}, {"start": 447.0, "text": "screenshots to you without ever"}, {"start": 449.0, "text": "leaving your app."}, {"start": 451.0, "text": "And second, testers are prompted"}, {"start": 454.0, "text": "any time a crash occurs so they"}, {"start": 456.0, "text": "can quickly send you feedback"}, {"start": 457.0, "text": "about that crash."}, {"start": 459.0, "text": "And we'll also go over new"}, {"start": 462.0, "text": "sections in App Store Connect"}, {"start": 463.0, "text": "that let you manage all the"}, {"start": 464.0, "text": "feedback you collect through"}, {"start": 466.0, "text": "Test Flight, but first let's"}, {"start": 468.0, "text": "take a closer look at how"}, {"start": 470.0, "text": "testers can send you feedback in"}, {"start": 472.0, "text": "a demo on my iPhone."}, {"start": 480.0, "text": "So, my team invited me to test a"}, {"start": 482.0, "text": "beta version of their app called"}, {"start": 483.0, "text": "Forest Explorer."}, {"start": 485.0, "text": "It's still early in development"}, {"start": 487.0, "text": "and so there's lots for me to"}, {"start": 488.0, "text": "give feedback on."}, {"start": 490.0, "text": "Let's start testing it together."}, {"start": 493.0, "text": "Now when you launch that first"}, {"start": 495.0, "text": "version of an app, you see this"}, {"start": 497.0, "text": "new onboarding screen."}, {"start": 499.0, "text": "It tells you everything you need"}, {"start": 500.0, "text": "to know to get started and all"}, {"start": 502.0, "text": "you have to do is enter test"}, {"start": 503.0, "text": "notes on the builds in App Store"}, {"start": 505.0, "text": "Connect and it will display"}, {"start": 507.0, "text": "here."}, {"start": 508.0, "text": "So here I can see that my team"}, {"start": 509.0, "text": "wants me to be on the lookout"}, {"start": 511.0, "text": "for issues in layout and"}, {"start": 512.0, "text": "usability."}, {"start": 514.0, "text": "Sounds good to me so I'll tap"}, {"start": 516.0, "text": "next."}, {"start": 517.0, "text": "Here we see steps on how to"}, {"start": 519.0, "text": "start giving feedback just by"}, {"start": 520.0, "text": "taking a screenshot."}, {"start": 522.0, "text": "I'm excited to give it a try."}, {"start": 524.0, "text": "So let's start testing."}, {"start": 527.0, "text": "Here's Forest Explorer."}, {"start": 529.0, "text": "So you see my photo feed and"}, {"start": 532.0, "text": "some trails on the feed, and"}, {"start": 534.0, "text": "right off the bat I can see that"}, {"start": 535.0, "text": "the Half Dome Trail, it's kind"}, {"start": 537.0, "text": "of darker in text in comparison"}, {"start": 539.0, "text": "to the other trails."}, {"start": 540.0, "text": "So this is a good opportunity"}, {"start": 541.0, "text": "for me to send some feedback."}, {"start": 544.0, "text": "I'll take a screenshot, tap on"}, {"start": 546.0, "text": "the preview, and here when you"}, {"start": 548.0, "text": "tap done, there's a new Share"}, {"start": 551.0, "text": "Beta Feedback Option."}, {"start": 553.0, "text": "This is available to all beta"}, {"start": 554.0, "text": "apps that's feedback enabled."}, {"start": 557.0, "text": "Tap on that it opens up a"}, {"start": 559.0, "text": "dialogue for me to enter more"}, {"start": 561.0, "text": "information."}, {"start": 562.0, "text": "Because I'm a Public Link tester"}, {"start": 564.0, "text": "I have the option to include an"}, {"start": 565.0, "text": "email address with this piece of"}, {"start": 567.0, "text": "feedback, but for now I'll just"}, {"start": 569.0, "text": "add some comments."}, {"start": 571.0, "text": "The text should be more"}, {"start": 573.0, "text": "consistent with the other trails"}, {"start": 578.0, "text": "and I'll tap submit and that's"}, {"start": 580.0, "text": "it."}, {"start": 581.0, "text": "I just sent some feedback."}, {"start": 587.0, "text": "Thank you."}, {"start": 588.0, "text": "Let's keep looking around."}, {"start": 590.0, "text": "On a trail, I see some trails"}, {"start": 592.0, "text": "that I've saved on this app, and"}, {"start": 593.0, "text": "I can see that the icons on the"}, {"start": 596.0, "text": "lower left are kind of clipped"}, {"start": 597.0, "text": "off-screen."}, {"start": 599.0, "text": "So this might be a good place"}, {"start": 600.0, "text": "for me to send some more"}, {"start": 601.0, "text": "feedback."}, {"start": 602.0, "text": "I'll take a screenshot and while"}, {"start": 605.0, "text": "I'm at it I'll take a second"}, {"start": 606.0, "text": "screenshot too and that way I"}, {"start": 609.0, "text": "can crop the first one, but"}, {"start": 611.0, "text": "leave the second one intact for"}, {"start": 612.0, "text": "context."}, {"start": 614.0, "text": "I'll even mark it up just to"}, {"start": 617.0, "text": "point out where the issue is"}, {"start": 618.0, "text": "happening, and I'll tap done and"}, {"start": 621.0, "text": "share beta feedback."}, {"start": 622.0, "text": "Again, I can include comments"}, {"start": 624.0, "text": "about what the issue is, the"}, {"start": 627.0, "text": "icons are clipped off-screen,"}, {"start": 629.0, "text": "and I'll tap submit."}, {"start": 632.0, "text": "And that's it."}, {"start": 634.0, "text": "I've sent multiple screenshots."}, {"start": 636.0, "text": "Isn't that awesome?"}, {"start": 642.0, "text": "Let's keep testing around. I'll tap on nearby and see what"}, {"start": 644.0, "text": "trails are around and let's find"}, {"start": 646.0, "text": "a Half Dome Trail on the map."}, {"start": 649.0, "text": "Okay, Forest Explorer just"}, {"start": 650.0, "text": "crashed and this is a new"}, {"start": 652.0, "text": "feature that's a part of"}, {"start": 653.0, "text": "feedback."}, {"start": 654.0, "text": "Now when your beta apps crash,"}, {"start": 656.0, "text": "testers are prompted to share"}, {"start": 658.0, "text": "feedback about the crash."}, {"start": 660.0, "text": "So I know my team will want to"}, {"start": 661.0, "text": "know about this so I'll tap"}, {"start": 663.0, "text": "share and here I can include"}, {"start": 665.0, "text": "steps on what caused the crash."}, {"start": 668.0, "text": "Tapped on the Half Dome Trail"}, {"start": 670.0, "text": "and the app crashed."}, {"start": 674.0, "text": "And that's it."}, {"start": 678.0, "text": "I've just sent some crash"}, {"start": 679.0, "text": "feedback to my team and they'll"}, {"start": 680.0, "text": "know where to start debugging"}, {"start": 682.0, "text": "thanks to the feedback I sent."}, {"start": 683.0, "text": "So I think I'm done testing"}, {"start": 685.0, "text": "Forest Explorer for now, but as"}, {"start": 688.0, "text": "you can see, I've been able to"}, {"start": 691.0, "text": "send a bunch of valuable"}, {"start": 692.0, "text": "feedback in just a few minutes"}, {"start": 694.0, "text": "of testing. Isn't that exciting?"}, {"start": 701.0, "text": "These are some really great features and sending feedback"}, {"start": 703.0, "text": "through TestFlight has never"}, {"start": 704.0, "text": "been easier and as a developer,"}, {"start": 706.0, "text": "you don't have to do any extra"}, {"start": 707.0, "text": "work to get quality feedback"}, {"start": 710.0, "text": "from your testers."}, {"start": 712.0, "text": "So finally, let's talk about"}, {"start": 713.0, "text": "managing the feedback in App"}, {"start": 714.0, "text": "Store Connect."}, {"start": 716.0, "text": "You'll be able to view feedback"}, {"start": 718.0, "text": "submissions shortly after you"}, {"start": 719.0, "text": "receive them and you'll have"}, {"start": 721.0, "text": "helpful filters where you can"}, {"start": 723.0, "text": "find feedback that's important"}, {"start": 725.0, "text": "to you."}, {"start": 727.0, "text": "Each feedback submission will"}, {"start": 728.0, "text": "include details about the tester"}, {"start": 730.0, "text": "and their device and each"}, {"start": 732.0, "text": "feedback will be available to"}, {"start": 733.0, "text": "download in a zip file."}, {"start": 735.0, "text": "And in cases where you want to"}, {"start": 737.0, "text": "stop receiving feedback, you can"}, {"start": 739.0, "text": "disable it too."}, {"start": 741.0, "text": "So let's take a look at these in more detail."}, {"start": 744.0, "text": "To manage your crash feedback"}, {"start": 745.0, "text": "just select the Crashes tab in"}, {"start": 747.0, "text": "TestFlight and from here you'll"}, {"start": 749.0, "text": "view detailed information about"}, {"start": 751.0, "text": "all the crashes you've received"}, {"start": 753.0, "text": "from your testers."}, {"start": 755.0, "text": "You can filter crashes by things"}, {"start": 756.0, "text": "like App Version, Build Version"}, {"start": 758.0, "text": "or Device Model to help find"}, {"start": 760.0, "text": "specific crashes you're looking"}, {"start": 761.0, "text": "for, and each piece of feedback"}, {"start": 764.0, "text": "contains useful details about"}, {"start": 766.0, "text": "the tester and their device at"}, {"start": 768.0, "text": "the time of the crash."}, {"start": 770.0, "text": "So you'll find things like"}, {"start": 772.0, "text": "connection type and free disk"}, {"start": 773.0, "text": "space available or even the"}, {"start": 775.0, "text": "battery life of the device when"}, {"start": 777.0, "text": "the app crashed."}, {"start": 779.0, "text": "And if you need to share"}, {"start": 780.0, "text": "feedback with members of your"}, {"start": 781.0, "text": "team outside of App Store"}, {"start": 783.0, "text": "Connect, you can download a zip"}, {"start": 785.0, "text": "file too and it'll include"}, {"start": 787.0, "text": "everything you see plus the"}, {"start": 789.0, "text": "crash log when the crash"}, {"start": 790.0, "text": "happened."}, {"start": 792.0, "text": "Now it's even easier for you to"}, {"start": 793.0, "text": "track down what caused your app"}, {"start": 794.0, "text": "to crash."}, {"start": 795.0, "text": "So what about the screenshots"}, {"start": 798.0, "text": "that your testers send you?"}, {"start": 801.0, "text": "Those live in the Screenshots"}, {"start": 802.0, "text": "Tab in TestFlight."}, {"start": 804.0, "text": "You'll be able to find a gallery"}, {"start": 806.0, "text": "of screenshots feedback that"}, {"start": 808.0, "text": "your testers have submitted."}, {"start": 811.0, "text": "Just like in crashes you can"}, {"start": 812.0, "text": "filter screenshots by some"}, {"start": 814.0, "text": "helpful filters."}, {"start": 815.0, "text": "For example, you may want to"}, {"start": 817.0, "text": "look for some feedback from"}, {"start": 818.0, "text": "testers using different devices"}, {"start": 820.0, "text": "than the ones you normally build"}, {"start": 821.0, "text": "with."}, {"start": 823.0, "text": "So you can select the device"}, {"start": 825.0, "text": "like the iPhone SE, for example."}, {"start": 828.0, "text": "And now filtered you can"}, {"start": 830.0, "text": "discover any issues on smaller"}, {"start": 832.0, "text": "screens. So here we see a couple of"}, {"start": 834.0, "text": "screenshots testers have sent"}, {"start": 835.0, "text": "about Forest Explorer."}, {"start": 837.0, "text": "Let's take a look at one more"}, {"start": 838.0, "text": "detail."}, {"start": 840.0, "text": "This tester is reporting a major"}, {"start": 842.0, "text": "layout issue similar to the one"}, {"start": 844.0, "text": "we saw earlier."}, {"start": 847.0, "text": "Screenshot feedbacks contain the"}, {"start": 849.0, "text": "same helpful details that you'll"}, {"start": 850.0, "text": "find in crash feedback."}, {"start": 853.0, "text": "So you'll find things like screen resolution, device model"}, {"start": 855.0, "text": "or iOS version of the device."}, {"start": 858.0, "text": "So paired with screenshots"}, {"start": 860.0, "text": "you'll be able to better"}, {"start": 861.0, "text": "troubleshoot the testers"}, {"start": 863.0, "text": "feedback."}, {"start": 864.0, "text": "You can also download a zip file"}, {"start": 866.0, "text": "too and it'll include all the"}, {"start": 868.0, "text": "screenshots you see in"}, {"start": 869.0, "text": "TestFlight plus the details that"}, {"start": 872.0, "text": "are in App Store Connect."}, {"start": 874.0, "text": "If at any point you want to stop"}, {"start": 877.0, "text": "collecting feedback, you can"}, {"start": 879.0, "text": "disable it at the tester group"}, {"start": 881.0, "text": "level."}, {"start": 882.0, "text": "This means that your testers"}, {"start": 883.0, "text": "will no longer see the"}, {"start": 885.0, "text": "onboarding screen or be able to"}, {"start": 887.0, "text": "send you feedback from directly"}, {"start": 889.0, "text": "within your app, but you can"}, {"start": 890.0, "text": "re-enable this at any time."}, {"start": 892.0, "text": "So these are some of the ways"}, {"start": 895.0, "text": "you can manage feedback that you"}, {"start": 897.0, "text": "receive through TestFlight and"}, {"start": 898.0, "text": "App Store Connect."}, {"start": 900.0, "text": "With all these improvements,"}, {"start": 901.0, "text": "you'll be able to receive more"}, {"start": 903.0, "text": "effective feedback at any point"}, {"start": 905.0, "text": "during the testing phase and"}, {"start": 907.0, "text": "testers can start sending you"}, {"start": 908.0, "text": "feedback today."}, {"start": 910.0, "text": "Anyone running iOS 13 will be"}, {"start": 913.0, "text": "able to use all of these new"}, {"start": 914.0, "text": "features in TestFlight."}, {"start": 917.0, "text": "We're really excited about"}, {"start": 918.0, "text": "TestFlight feedback, and we want"}, {"start": 921.0, "text": "to start receiving feedback from"}, {"start": 922.0, "text": "you too."}, {"start": 923.0, "text": "So today we're announcing the"}, {"start": 926.0, "text": "TestFlight Beta Program."}, {"start": 929.0, "text": "This means that you can get"}, {"start": 930.0, "text": "early versions of TestFlight for"}, {"start": 932.0, "text": "iOS, test the latest features"}, {"start": 934.0, "text": "and give us feedback."}, {"start": 936.0, "text": "You can sign up for the beta on"}, {"start": 938.0, "text": "a Developer Downloads Page."}, {"start": 940.0, "text": "We're excited to receive"}, {"start": 941.0, "text": "feedback and help improve"}, {"start": 943.0, "text": "TestFlight even more."}, {"start": 945.0, "text": "Thank you so much, and I'll give"}, {"start": 946.0, "text": "the stage back to Tommy."}, {"start": 955.0, "text": "Thanks, Payam."}, {"start": 956.0, "text": "Those are great new ways to"}, {"start": 957.0, "text": "receive feedback about your beta"}, {"start": 959.0, "text": "apps. After you've received feedback"}, {"start": 961.0, "text": "and you've iterated on your app,"}, {"start": 963.0, "text": "it's time to transition to the"}, {"start": 965.0, "text": "App Store, but first something"}, {"start": 968.0, "text": "you'll likely think about is how"}, {"start": 969.0, "text": "to price your app."}, {"start": 971.0, "text": "The App Store enables you to"}, {"start": 973.0, "text": "generate sales globally to"}, {"start": 976.0, "text": "millions of customers in 155"}, {"start": 978.0, "text": "territories."}, {"start": 979.0, "text": "We ensure that you can do"}, {"start": 982.0, "text": "business with as many customers"}, {"start": 983.0, "text": "as possible by consistently"}, {"start": 985.0, "text": "adding support for new payment"}, {"start": 987.0, "text": "methods so customers can pay for"}, {"start": 989.0, "text": "your app in whichever method"}, {"start": 991.0, "text": "they prefer."}, {"start": 992.0, "text": "And with new support for the"}, {"start": 994.0, "text": "Korean won, you can now generate"}, {"start": 996.0, "text": "sales across 45 unique"}, {"start": 998.0, "text": "currencies."}, {"start": 1000.0, "text": "Although you can generate sales"}, {"start": 1002.0, "text": "across all currencies, your"}, {"start": 1004.0, "text": "business doesn't need to handle"}, {"start": 1005.0, "text": "payment for all them because we"}, {"start": 1008.0, "text": "consolidate all of your proceeds"}, {"start": 1010.0, "text": "into a single payment to your"}, {"start": 1011.0, "text": "bank account."}, {"start": 1012.0, "text": "For those of you who offer"}, {"start": 1015.0, "text": "subscriptions you have 200"}, {"start": 1017.0, "text": "different price tiers to choose"}, {"start": 1018.0, "text": "from, and we recently released a"}, {"start": 1022.0, "text": "feature called Subscription"}, {"start": 1023.0, "text": "Offers."}, {"start": 1025.0, "text": "These allow you to offer a"}, {"start": 1026.0, "text": "discount or free period of"}, {"start": 1028.0, "text": "service for subscriptions and"}, {"start": 1031.0, "text": "you decide which subscribers"}, {"start": 1033.0, "text": "qualify for the offer."}, {"start": 1035.0, "text": "This is a great way to retain"}, {"start": 1038.0, "text": "existing subscribers or to win"}, {"start": 1041.0, "text": "back previous subscribers."}, {"start": 1048.0, "text": "There's a lot of great ways to"}, {"start": 1050.0, "text": "utilize subscriptions, but I"}, {"start": 1051.0, "text": "won't go into detail here"}, {"start": 1052.0, "text": "because we have two sessions on"}, {"start": 1054.0, "text": "this tomorrow, and I encourage"}, {"start": 1055.0, "text": "you to check these out."}, {"start": 1059.0, "text": "Now you've nailed down the"}, {"start": 1060.0, "text": "pricing strategy and next"}, {"start": 1062.0, "text": "there's something equally"}, {"start": 1063.0, "text": "important to think about and"}, {"start": 1065.0, "text": "that's how your app is"}, {"start": 1066.0, "text": "represented in the App Store"}, {"start": 1067.0, "text": "Product Page."}, {"start": 1070.0, "text": "This involves app naming,"}, {"start": 1072.0, "text": "description and keywords which"}, {"start": 1074.0, "text": "make it easier for customers to"}, {"start": 1076.0, "text": "discover your app and when it"}, {"start": 1079.0, "text": "comes to reaching as many people"}, {"start": 1080.0, "text": "as possible, a key aspect is"}, {"start": 1083.0, "text": "localization."}, {"start": 1084.0, "text": "If we take English as an"}, {"start": 1087.0, "text": "example, only about 5% of the"}, {"start": 1089.0, "text": "world speaks English as a first"}, {"start": 1091.0, "text": "language."}, {"start": 1092.0, "text": "So when you localize your"}, {"start": 1093.0, "text": "product page there's a huge"}, {"start": 1095.0, "text": "opportunity to reach more"}, {"start": 1096.0, "text": "people."}, {"start": 1097.0, "text": "We focus on supporting a lot of"}, {"start": 1100.0, "text": "languages, and we recently added"}, {"start": 1102.0, "text": "support for more."}, {"start": 1103.0, "text": "To tell you more about these"}, {"start": 1104.0, "text": "languages and how you localize"}, {"start": 1106.0, "text": "your product page, I'd like to"}, {"start": 1107.0, "text": "invite Ethar  on"}, {"start": 1108.0, "text": "stage."}, {"start": 1117.0, "text": "Thanks Tommy. Salam everyone."}, {"start": 1118.0, "text": "My name is Ethar Elsaka [assumed"}, {"start": 1120.0, "text": "spelling], and I'm an engineer"}, {"start": 1122.0, "text": "on App Store Connect."}, {"start": 1124.0, "text": "Today we will talk about a very"}, {"start": 1126.0, "text": "exciting feature related to your"}, {"start": 1128.0, "text": "apps metadata."}, {"start": 1129.0, "text": "We believe that localization is"}, {"start": 1131.0, "text": "the key aspect for making your"}, {"start": 1134.0, "text": "apps more accessible to the"}, {"start": 1136.0, "text": "global audience."}, {"start": 1137.0, "text": "We are always working hard to"}, {"start": 1139.0, "text": "introduce new language support"}, {"start": 1141.0, "text": "and just this past year we"}, {"start": 1144.0, "text": "introduced nine new languages"}, {"start": 1148.0, "text": "bringing the total number of"}, {"start": 1149.0, "text": "languages supported by the App"}, {"start": 1152.0, "text": "Store to 37 languages."}, {"start": 1160.0, "text": "Actually let me pause here and"}, {"start": 1162.0, "text": "give you a pop quiz."}, {"start": 1165.0, "text": "Who knows what does aikhtibar"}, {"start": 1167.0, "text": "mean?"}, {"start": 1171.0, "text": "And what about tatbiq?"}, {"start": 1175.0, "text": "So here is your first Arabic"}, {"start": 1177.0, "text": "lesson."}, {"start": 1178.0, "text": "Aikhtibar means test and tatbiq"}, {"start": 1181.0, "text": "means app."}, {"start": 1182.0, "text": "If you wonder why I give you"}, {"start": 1184.0, "text": "this Arabic quiz, this is"}, {"start": 1186.0, "text": "because Arabic is one of the"}, {"start": 1188.0, "text": "right to left languages and"}, {"start": 1190.0, "text": "today I'm very excited to share"}, {"start": 1193.0, "text": "that for the first time in the"}, {"start": 1195.0, "text": "App Store with iOS 13 we are"}, {"start": 1198.0, "text": "supporting Arabic and Hebrew."}, {"start": 1208.0, "text": "So now these customers can set"}, {"start": 1212.0, "text": "their iPhone language to Arabic"}, {"start": 1214.0, "text": "or Hebrew and enjoy browsing our"}, {"start": 1217.0, "text": "App Store content in their"}, {"start": 1219.0, "text": "preferred language."}, {"start": 1220.0, "text": "As you can imagine, this is not"}, {"start": 1224.0, "text": "a small effort and it requires"}, {"start": 1227.0, "text": "a rethink of almost every"}, {"start": 1229.0, "text": "aspect of display and"}, {"start": 1230.0, "text": "interaction, UI layout,"}, {"start": 1233.0, "text": "navigation controls, animation"}, {"start": 1236.0, "text": "and editorial artwork."}, {"start": 1240.0, "text": "We believe that the presence of"}, {"start": 1242.0, "text": "localized app and editorial"}, {"start": 1245.0, "text": "content will lead to a deeper"}, {"start": 1248.0, "text": "and more integrated experience"}, {"start": 1250.0, "text": "for hundreds of millions of"}, {"start": 1253.0, "text": "customers on iOS and Mac, from"}, {"start": 1257.0, "text": "browse and purchase through App"}, {"start": 1259.0, "text": "Launch."}, {"start": 1262.0, "text": "So to let these customers enjoy"}, {"start": 1264.0, "text": "our apps in their native"}, {"start": 1267.0, "text": "language, we need to localize"}, {"start": 1270.0, "text": "ours apps in App Store Connect"}, {"start": 1273.0, "text": "and now let me show you how we"}, {"start": 1275.0, "text": "can do that."}, {"start": 1281.0, "text": "Once I'm at the home page, I"}, {"start": 1284.0, "text": "will click on my apps, which"}, {"start": 1286.0, "text": "contains all the apps under the"}, {"start": 1287.0, "text": "Nature Lab team."}, {"start": 1293.0, "text": "I choose to localize the first"}, {"start": 1295.0, "text": "Explorer App to make it easier"}, {"start": 1298.0, "text": "for my friends and family in"}, {"start": 1299.0, "text": "Egypt to use it."}, {"start": 1301.0, "text": "I don't know where because we"}, {"start": 1303.0, "text": "don't have forest in Egypt but"}, {"start": 1305.0, "text": "maybe when they come visit."}, {"start": 1310.0, "text": "Now I need to select the version"}, {"start": 1311.0, "text": "that I want to localize and"}, {"start": 1313.0, "text": "since this app has never been"}, {"start": 1316.0, "text": "released it has only one"}, {"start": 1318.0, "text": "version."}, {"start": 1319.0, "text": "Let me add Arabic language from"}, {"start": 1322.0, "text": "the drop-down menu on the right"}, {"start": 1326.0, "text": "and now I'm ready to localize my"}, {"start": 1329.0, "text": "app."}, {"start": 1333.0, "text": "I will need the promotional text"}, {"start": 1335.0, "text": "and since right to left is new"}, {"start": 1340.0, "text": "in the App Store Connect, I will"}, {"start": 1342.0, "text": "give the first Explorer for the"}, {"start": 1344.0, "text": "Arab people for one year for"}, {"start": 1346.0, "text": "free."}, {"start": 1348.0, "text": "I also need the description"}, {"start": 1352.0, "text": "which has detailed information"}, {"start": 1354.0, "text": "about the Forest Explorer"}, {"start": 1356.0, "text": "functionalities and features."}, {"start": 1359.0, "text": "I also need to add meaningful"}, {"start": 1362.0, "text": "keywords to make my app more"}, {"start": 1365.0, "text": "discovered."}, {"start": 1366.0, "text": "I can save for now, but I still"}, {"start": 1370.0, "text": "need to add the screenshots and"}, {"start": 1374.0, "text": "the support URL to be able to"}, {"start": 1378.0, "text": "submit my app for review."}, {"start": 1379.0, "text": "Now let me show you how the"}, {"start": 1382.0, "text": "Forest Explorer will look in the"}, {"start": 1386.0, "text": "App Store."}, {"start": 1388.0, "text": "Here is how the Forest Explorer"}, {"start": 1389.0, "text": "will look in the App Store after"}, {"start": 1391.0, "text": "releasing it."}, {"start": 1392.0, "text": "Awesome."}, {"start": 1401.0, "text": "Also I'm super excited that now"}, {"start": 1403.0, "text": "TestFlight is available in"}, {"start": 1406.0, "text": "Arabic and Hebrew, which I"}, {"start": 1408.0, "text": "believe would provide a good"}, {"start": 1410.0, "text": "experience for Arabic and Hebrew"}, {"start": 1412.0, "text": "speaking tester while testing"}, {"start": 1414.0, "text": "apps."}, {"start": 1417.0, "text": "To summarize, we believe that"}, {"start": 1420.0, "text": "localization is important to"}, {"start": 1423.0, "text": "provide the best possible app"}, {"start": 1424.0, "text": "experience for everyone."}, {"start": 1427.0, "text": "We have embraced this and now"}, {"start": 1430.0, "text": "App Store supports 39 languages"}, {"start": 1432.0, "text": "including Arabic and Hebrew,"}, {"start": 1434.0, "text": "with right to left support for"}, {"start": 1437.0, "text": "the first time today your app"}, {"start": 1440.0, "text": "can reach over 250 million"}, {"start": 1443.0, "text": "potential customers."}, {"start": 1447.0, "text": "And, finally, don't forget to"}, {"start": 1449.0, "text": "submit your Arabic and Hebrew"}, {"start": 1451.0, "text": "localization in App Store"}, {"start": 1453.0, "text": "Connect today."}, {"start": 1455.0, "text": "Thank you and let me hand it"}, {"start": 1456.0, "text": "back to Tommy."}, {"start": 1464.0, "text": "Thank you, Ethar."}, {"start": 1466.0, "text": "Localizing your product page is"}, {"start": 1468.0, "text": "a great way to improve"}, {"start": 1470.0, "text": "discoverability and now you can"}, {"start": 1472.0, "text": "do that for more languages than"}, {"start": 1474.0, "text": "ever before."}, {"start": 1476.0, "text": "Now you've built and iterated on"}, {"start": 1478.0, "text": "your app, you've set a pricing"}, {"start": 1480.0, "text": "strategy and you've localized"}, {"start": 1482.0, "text": "your product page."}, {"start": 1484.0, "text": "The final step is submitting for"}, {"start": 1485.0, "text": "review."}, {"start": 1487.0, "text": "To make sure that goes as smooth"}, {"start": 1488.0, "text": "as possible we have some"}, {"start": 1490.0, "text": "guidelines to keep in mind."}, {"start": 1493.0, "text": "The first one, of course, is"}, {"start": 1495.0, "text": "please test your app on a device"}, {"start": 1496.0, "text": "before submitting it."}, {"start": 1499.0, "text": "Ensure you fill out all app"}, {"start": 1501.0, "text": "information and metadata."}, {"start": 1503.0, "text": "Keep your contact info up to"}, {"start": 1506.0, "text": "date so we can reach you if"}, {"start": 1508.0, "text": "there are any issues."}, {"start": 1509.0, "text": "And if your app requires a"}, {"start": 1512.0, "text": "login, well, that's something"}, {"start": 1513.0, "text": "we're going to need in order to"}, {"start": 1515.0, "text": "review your app."}, {"start": 1516.0, "text": "So, please add credentials for a"}, {"start": 1518.0, "text": "demo account to the review notes. Also explain any non-obvious"}, {"start": 1519.0, "text": "features and in-app purchases in"}, {"start": 1520.0, "text": "the review notes."}, {"start": 1521.0, "text": "I also want to share some"}, {"start": 1524.0, "text": "frequent feedback that we give"}, {"start": 1528.0, "text": "developers during app review."}, {"start": 1535.0, "text": "Provide accurate screenshots"}, {"start": 1537.0, "text": "that show your app in use and"}, {"start": 1540.0, "text": "make sure the UI corresponds to"}, {"start": 1542.0, "text": "the correct device type."}, {"start": 1546.0, "text": "Only ask for login credentials"}, {"start": 1548.0, "text": "when it's necessary to core"}, {"start": 1550.0, "text": "functionality."}, {"start": 1551.0, "text": "Apps cannot require personal"}, {"start": 1553.0, "text": "info in order to function."}, {"start": 1557.0, "text": "When requesting access to user"}, {"start": 1559.0, "text": "data, you need to provide"}, {"start": 1561.0, "text": "purpose strings that clearly"}, {"start": 1562.0, "text": "describe how your app will use"}, {"start": 1565.0, "text": "the data."}, {"start": 1567.0, "text": "Finally, if you offer"}, {"start": 1568.0, "text": "subscriptions, make sure they're"}, {"start": 1569.0, "text": "straight forward and very easy"}, {"start": 1571.0, "text": "to understand."}, {"start": 1572.0, "text": "Now that your app has been"}, {"start": 1576.0, "text": "reviewed you're ready for the"}, {"start": 1577.0, "text": "App Store and after your app has"}, {"start": 1581.0, "text": "spent some time on the store,"}, {"start": 1582.0, "text": "you'll start to receive customer"}, {"start": 1584.0, "text": "ratings and reviews."}, {"start": 1586.0, "text": "A great way to see and respond"}, {"start": 1589.0, "text": "to reviews is with App Store"}, {"start": 1590.0, "text": "Connect for iOS."}, {"start": 1592.0, "text": "You can also enable"}, {"start": 1595.0, "text": "notifications for customer"}, {"start": 1596.0, "text": "reviews so you can see"}, {"start": 1597.0, "text": "immediately when your app"}, {"start": 1599.0, "text": "receives a new review."}, {"start": 1600.0, "text": "It's also important to mention"}, {"start": 1604.0, "text": "that App Store Connect for iOS"}, {"start": 1606.0, "text": "is now a localized app with"}, {"start": 1608.0, "text": "support for 14 languages so you"}, {"start": 1611.0, "text": "can see that localization is an"}, {"start": 1613.0, "text": "important area of focus for all"}, {"start": 1615.0, "text": "the tools available to you and"}, {"start": 1617.0, "text": "your team."}, {"start": 1620.0, "text": "In addition to customer reviews,"}, {"start": 1622.0, "text": "you have another important tool"}, {"start": 1624.0, "text": "that can help you decide where"}, {"start": 1625.0, "text": "to place your development"}, {"start": 1626.0, "text": "efforts and that's analytics."}, {"start": 1629.0, "text": "With App Analytics you get a"}, {"start": 1632.0, "text": "wealth of information into how"}, {"start": 1633.0, "text": "your app is performing on the"}, {"start": 1636.0, "text": "App Store."}, {"start": 1637.0, "text": "We recently added support for a"}, {"start": 1639.0, "text": "new platform and that's Mac OS."}, {"start": 1641.0, "text": "So you can access powerful"}, {"start": 1644.0, "text": "insight into how your app"}, {"start": 1646.0, "text": "performs on the Mac App Store."}, {"start": 1648.0, "text": "Some of the metrics available"}, {"start": 1652.0, "text": "for Mac will include"}, {"start": 1653.0, "text": "Impressions, which is the number"}, {"start": 1655.0, "text": "of times your app icon has been"}, {"start": 1656.0, "text": "viewed in the store."}, {"start": 1658.0, "text": "Product Page Views is the number"}, {"start": 1661.0, "text": "of times your product page has"}, {"start": 1662.0, "text": "been viewed."}, {"start": 1664.0, "text": "App Units shows how many times"}, {"start": 1666.0, "text": "your app was downloaded from the"}, {"start": 1667.0, "text": "store."}, {"start": 1669.0, "text": "And Sales will capture the total"}, {"start": 1672.0, "text": "amount billed through purchases"}, {"start": 1674.0, "text": "and in-app purchases."}, {"start": 1677.0, "text": "We're also introducing a"}, {"start": 1679.0, "text": "completely new metric for iOS"}, {"start": 1681.0, "text": "Apps called App Deletions."}, {"start": 1684.0, "text": "this will allow you to see the"}, {"start": 1686.0, "text": "number of times your app is"}, {"start": 1688.0, "text": "uninstalled from customer's"}, {"start": 1689.0, "text": "devices."}, {"start": 1690.0, "text": "You might use this to correlate"}, {"start": 1694.0, "text": "deletions with an issue in a"}, {"start": 1696.0, "text": "recent version of your app."}, {"start": 1699.0, "text": "Or another interesting view is"}, {"start": 1701.0, "text": "Deletions by Source Type which"}, {"start": 1703.0, "text": "shows if a given source is"}, {"start": 1705.0, "text": "better able to retain customers"}, {"start": 1707.0, "text": "or what source is resulting in"}, {"start": 1709.0, "text": "the most deletions."}, {"start": 1713.0, "text": "There's one more exciting"}, {"start": 1715.0, "text": "announcement about Sales Data."}, {"start": 1717.0, "text": "This is an entirely new time"}, {"start": 1719.0, "text": "range and level of granularity"}, {"start": 1721.0, "text": "for your sales data, the 24-Hour"}, {"start": 1725.0, "text": "Dashboard."}, {"start": 1726.0, "text": "This gives you an hour by hour"}, {"start": 1729.0, "text": "view into the last 24 hours of"}, {"start": 1731.0, "text": "sales performance."}, {"start": 1735.0, "text": "That's right."}, {"start": 1738.0, "text": "You no longer have to wait until"}, {"start": 1739.0, "text": "the next business day to view"}, {"start": 1741.0, "text": "your sales data."}, {"start": 1743.0, "text": "Let's take a look at the new"}, {"start": 1744.0, "text": "dashboard."}, {"start": 1745.0, "text": "Here we're looking at a sales"}, {"start": 1748.0, "text": "overview within Sales and"}, {"start": 1749.0, "text": "Trends, and we see sales data"}, {"start": 1751.0, "text": "for the last 7 days."}, {"start": 1753.0, "text": "If you filter this view, you can"}, {"start": 1755.0, "text": "narrow it down to a handful of"}, {"start": 1757.0, "text": "specific in-app purchases."}, {"start": 1759.0, "text": "At the bottom of the list we see"}, {"start": 1760.0, "text": "a new in-app purchase that is"}, {"start": 1762.0, "text": "just released today."}, {"start": 1763.0, "text": "You see that it doesn't have any"}, {"start": 1766.0, "text": "sales data yet."}, {"start": 1768.0, "text": "This is one case where you'll"}, {"start": 1769.0, "text": "want to use the 24-Hour"}, {"start": 1771.0, "text": "Dashboard."}, {"start": 1772.0, "text": "So if you click on the calendar"}, {"start": 1774.0, "text": "picker, you see a new option for"}, {"start": 1776.0, "text": "Last 24 Hours."}, {"start": 1779.0, "text": "That will take you to the 24-Hour Graph."}, {"start": 1783.0, "text": "Now you can see sales data on an"}, {"start": 1785.0, "text": "hourly basis and you can track"}, {"start": 1786.0, "text": "the success of your brand new"}, {"start": 1788.0, "text": "in-app purchase as it rolls out"}, {"start": 1790.0, "text": "to customers."}, {"start": 1791.0, "text": "You can see how this is a"}, {"start": 1793.0, "text": "powerful new way to view your"}, {"start": 1795.0, "text": "sales data."}, {"start": 1798.0, "text": "Within the App Lifecycle that"}, {"start": 1800.0, "text": "brings us back to Xcode where we"}, {"start": 1802.0, "text": "can take everything we've"}, {"start": 1803.0, "text": "learned so far and continue"}, {"start": 1805.0, "text": "creating great apps."}, {"start": 1808.0, "text": "We have some labs tomorrow at 9"}, {"start": 1810.0, "text": "and 3, where you can come ask us"}, {"start": 1812.0, "text": "questions about anything we've"}, {"start": 1814.0, "text": "talked about."}, {"start": 1816.0, "text": "As always, I can't wait to see"}, {"start": 1818.0, "text": "what you do with these new"}, {"start": 1819.0, "text": "capabilities."}, {"start": 1820.0, "text": "I hope all of you enjoy the rest"}, {"start": 1821.0, "text": "of your time here at WWDC."}]}